{"availability":"available","full":"kgtceo/run-coach","name":"run-coach","description":"A running training-plan engine (a mini-Runna) — deterministic training-science rules decide the plan (progressive overload, taper, Riegel paces), the LLM only drafts the athlete briefing, with an eval harness that checks the plan is safe. Illustrative demo. FastAPI + Next.js.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-27T18:45:31Z","updated":"2026-07-27T19:22:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://run-coach-azure.vercel.app","topics":["ai","anthropic","evals","fastapi","fitness","llm","nextjs","python","running","training-plans"],"demo":"https://run-coach.kareemghazal.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:46.778Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:46.778Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T02:58:46.778Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:23:24.004Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:11:23.669Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T02:58:46.778Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A running training-plan engine (a mini-Runna). Give it a goal race, your recent fitness and how many days a week you can run; a deterministic training-science engine decides the plan — and the LLM only drafts the athlete-facing summary + next-session briefing, grounded strictly in the decided sessions. Ships an eval harness that checks the plan is safe.","Built around one idea: measure LLM systems, don't vibe them. For something an athlete trusts with their body, the training decisions must be rules — the model only writes them up.","Illustrative demo — not personalised coaching or medical advice."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kgtceo/run-coach/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cd02840d50b368ec3a0fad3b62b188bf7d1577da7fee2a415dd59fe4a597c313","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:23:24.200Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"20